Subject: [PATCH 55/67] =?UTF-8?q?feat(aligram):=20hidden=20folders=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20filter=20hidden=20dialogs=20from=20dialog=20list=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?(copy,=20live=20list=20untouched)?=
